{
  "id": "poem-040",
  "body": "<div class=\"poem-text\"><p class=\"poem-stanza\" id=\"verse-1\"><span class=\"poem-line\">智慧是什么？</span><span class=\"poem-line\">是高僧隐士？</span><span class=\"poem-line\">是某种玄之又玄的现象？</span><span class=\"poem-line\">等等等？</span></p><p class=\"poem-stanza\" id=\"verse-2\"><span class=\"poem-line\">这些答案是否能确切击中你内心的靶子？</span></p><p class=\"poem-stanza\" id=\"verse-3\"><span class=\"poem-line\">它不在书斋与草庐中，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">它在高铁飞驰而过扬起的尘土里。</span></p></div><figure class=\"poem-illustration\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"poem-art-open\" data-poem-art=\"/books/jing-mi-de-kuang-chao/art/040.webp\" data-caption=\"《心跳》\" aria-label=\"放大欣赏插画《心跳》\"><img src=\"/books/jing-mi-de-kuang-chao/art/040.webp\" width=\"885\" height=\"1050\" alt=\"亮子绘制的原书插画《心跳》\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></button><figcaption>《心跳》 · 亮子<span>轻触画面，放大欣赏</span></figcaption></figure><p class=\"poem-original-page\">原书第 40 页</p>"
}
